{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47733","headline":"荅常学士 · 李梦符","name":"荅常学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罢修儒业罢修真，养拙藏愚春复春。\n到老不疎林里鹿，平生难见日边人。\n洞桃深处千林锦，岩雪铺时万草新。\n深谢名贤远相访，求闻难博凤爲邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李梦符","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}